# A kick of light on a resting pillar: below a threshold amplitude it dies out, above it the pillar answers with one full pulse, sooner for a stronger kick.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title One pillar, kick of amplitude 1.6
sites 1
kick 1 amplitude=1.6
run 600
expect total 1
expect last 19.54802 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 19.54802 0.003
expect peak 1 57.255932 2e-4
expect fired 1 yes
